{"version":1,"content":"<p>洪嘉豪自言不諳浪漫，盼與不重儀式感的伴侶相知相守，不願為迎合對方而勉強自己。</p><p>從年少失戀時邊流淚邊做功課，到如今理性面對聚散，他對感情漸有體悟。</p><p>成為公眾人物後，他不再輕易表露喜怒，轉而將心事寫進歌曲，以音樂寄託情緒。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:40.648540+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:09.983549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.903759+00:00","content_hash":"ab6768e64b917f8b231f8f87744875c51bff5cdf128ca78e8029ac466589d005","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}